sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Protect as protect middleware
    participant Router as messageRoutes.js
    participant DB as MongoDB Message

    Client->>Protect: POST /api/messages/ content, groupId, Bearer token
    Protect->>Router: next() req.user set
    Router->>DB: Message.create sender, content, group
    DB-->>Router: message
    Router->>DB: Message.findById(message._id) populate sender
    DB-->>Router: populatedMessage
    Router-->>Client: 200 populatedMessage

    Note over Router,Client: catch returns 400 with error.Message, a bug, should be error.message
    Note over Client: Client separately emits socket new message for realtime relay, this route only persists to DB
